#. module: presenly_saas
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas.view_presenly_saas_config_form
msgid ""
"A failed check never changes the stored subscription status.\n"
"                                Only a real answer from the SaaS server can."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan yang gagal tidak pernah mengubah status langganan\n"
"                                yang tersimpan. Hanya jawaban nyata dari server SaaS yang bisa."

#. module: presenly_saas
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"A label only, so a sandbox connection is never mistaken for production "
"during support."
msgstr ""
"Hanya penanda, agar koneksi sandbox tidak tertukar dengan produksi saat "
"penanganan masalah."

