#. module: presenly_saas
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:presenly_saas.field_presenly_saas_config__cron_sync_minutes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:presenly_saas.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"How often the scheduled pull of recent data runs. 0 turns that cron off: "
"data is still refreshed when its list is opened, but nothing keeps data "
"nobody looks at up to date."
msgstr "Seberapa sering penarikan terjadwal data terbaru berjalan. 0 mematikan cron\n"
"itu: data tetap disegarkan saat daftarnya dibuka, tetapi tidak ada yang\n"
"menjaga data yang tidak pernah dilihat."

